looks like when I run it.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.920
Well, just by
clicking this, it'll

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:45.613
set up Cloud Run
on their account.

00:02:45.613 --> 00:02:46.780
It'll get the code in there.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:47.660
It'll install it.

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.820
And then you'll have that
server list ready to go.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:50.280
